{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/391419-dtf-question-pillar-of-faith-tormented-against-other-supernaturals","id":391419,"title":"[DtF Question] Pillar Of Faith Tormented Against Other Supernaturals","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-03T07:38:54-08:00","id":391419,"title":"[DtF Question] Pillar Of Faith Tormented Against Other Supernaturals","content":"Hi All,<br /> <br /> i'm running a crossover game and i'm wondering of a Fallen could use the Tormented version of Pillar of Faith (Lore Of Celestials 3) as a defence against the supernatural powers of other splats?<br /> <br /> As it stands the Evocation says it can be used to take away successes from others efforts if the Demon knows the Celestial or True Name of the Demon the pc is using it against. I'm hoping this can be extended to other supernaturals whose name a Demon knows , for a Fallen NPC i'm about to introduce.<br /> <br /> Any thoughts on the matter welcomed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1919-muadib","name":"muadib","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1919_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-03T08:05:51-08:00","id":391448,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">I\u2019m inclined to say \u201cprobably not\u201d due to the Lore\u2019s basic description: <span style=\"font-family:georgia\">\u201cCentral to their duties was the Lore of the Celestials, comprising the knowledge of harnessing Heaven\u2019s will (and later, mortal Faith) to locate, inform, and support the efforts of the other celestials,\u201d</span> (Demon: the Fallen, p. 175).<br /> <br /> On the other hand, since we\u2019re talking about critters that helped God create the Universe, I think you\u2019re totally within your rights, as Storyteller, to say, \u201cYes, it does.\u201d Although the Fallen are a far cry from their former might, I do think it\u2019s thematically appropriate for a demon with Lore of the Celestials to make another splat\u2019s mojo a little harder.<br /> <br /> Are there combo-powers in DtF? Maybe a combination of Radiance and Celestials?<br /> <br /> My two oboli.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:8px\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\">&lt;signature&gt; something witty &lt;/signature&gt;</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/302-nazfool","name":"Nazfool","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar302_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"753"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-04T07:15:06-08:00","id":392572,"title":"","content":"I think it also depends on what splat you are trying to affect with it, and how their powers work.<br /> <br /> Vampires would probably not be affected (their power source is internal, and most of their powers are manifestations of that source), but a Mage's spells likely would be affected (they warp reality with their wills, like Fallen do).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />Avatar commissioned from the incomparable Melissa Uran.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/966-redford_blade","name":"Redford_Blade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}